{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33703","headline":"读惠山若冰师集因题故院三首 二 · 李骘","name":"读惠山若冰师集因题故院三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高怀逢异境，佳句想吟频。\n月冷松溪夜，烟浓草寺春。\n浮云将世远，清听与名新。\n不见开岩日，空爲拜影人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李骘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}